    "description": "The Sony WH-1000XM4C Wireless Noise Cancelling Over-Ear Headphones feature a foldable design and the legendary 1000X noise cancelling technology. Powered by the HD Noise Cancelling Processor QN1 and Dual Noise Sensor technology, these headphones effectively reduce environmental noise. They include a Personal Noise Cancellation Optimizer to tune noise cancellation based on individual factors like head size and glasses. For audio performance, 40 mm drivers with Liquid Crystal Polymer diaphragms deliver deep bass, while LDAC and DSEE Extreme™ ensure high-resolution wireless audio and restored detail in compressed files. The headphones offer up to 27 hours of battery life, with a quick charge feature providing one hour of playback from just 3 minutes of charging. Additional features include multipoint connection for two Bluetooth devices, Speak-to-Chat, Adaptive Sound Control, and an IR sensor that pauses playback when removed. The device is lightweight at approximately 253g and includes soft oval earpads for all-day comfort.",
